  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Estimates EU-Jamaica Cooperation Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This is the multiannual Programme Estimate (PE) for the European Union Jamaica Cooperation Facility (EU-JACF) Financing Agreement No. 43461. Activities under this PE will be financed from the Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument (NDICI) in the amount of &#xbf;1,500,000. The operational period of the PE includes implementation period of 56 months from December 9, 2022 to July 20, 2027 and a closure period of 8 months from July 21, 2027 to March 20, 2028.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;In line with the Financing Agreement, the overall objective of the project is to contribute to the implementation of the Government of Jamaica&#xbf;s development agenda. The &lt;strong&gt;specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt; of this PE are to provide support to the effective preparation/formulation, implementation and management of the Jamaica-EU cooperation, and to increase public knowledge and perception of the EU cooperation with Jamaica while enhancing the capacities of the Government and relevant stakeholders to efficiently implement national development objectives, through strategic communication and public diplomacy activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The project builds on the previous cooperation facilities between the Government and the EU Delegation. Over the years, these facilities have been instrumental in assisting the Government of Jamaica to advance key policy reform initiatives supported by the EU. It continues to be an important tool, being responsive to Government&#xbf;s needs and is able to provide sufficient expertise and technical assistance to support the EU and the PIOJ responsibility for programme oversight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The PE will be implemented through decentralised management with oversight from a Steering Committee inclusive of representation from the EU Delegation in Jamaica&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
